    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aot/BeanFactoryInitializationAotProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.aot\"><code>BeanFactoryInitializationAotProcessor</code></a> implementation used to encapsulate common data infrastructure concerns\nand preprocess the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/ConfigurableListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ConfigurableListableBeanFactory</code></a> ahead of the AOT compilation in order to prepare the\nSpring Data <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinitions</code></a> for AOT processing.",
      "translation": "用于封装通用数据基础设施关注点并提前对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/ConfigurableListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ConfigurableListableBeanFactory</code></a> 进行预处理，以便为 AOT 编译准备 Spring Data <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinitions</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aot/BeanFactoryInitializationAotProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.aot\"><code>BeanFactoryInitializationAotProcessor</code></a> 实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
